OL,3,GNEWSAGirl with language disorder to
OL,4,Agive public speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanding up to deliver a public speech
OL,7,Fwould seem a daunting task for many
OL,8,F12-year-olds.
OL,10,FBut Ridley, from Derby, will take on
OL,11,Fthe challenge to raise awareness of
OL,12,Fdevelopmental language disorder (DLD),
OL,13,Fa condition she was diagnosed with at
OL,14,Fthe age of five, that causes long-term
OL,15,Fchallenges with talking and
OL,16,Funderstanding words.
OL,18,FDespite having "difficulty finding
OL,19,Fwords", Ridley has decided to give a
OL,20,Fspeech and light up Derby Conference
OL,21,FCentre purple on Friday to mark DLD
OL,22,Fawareness day.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36202
