OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1792130183
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAGirl with language disorder to
OL,4,Agive public speech
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm going to be talking a lot about
OL,7,FDLD, because I'm a chatterbox about
OL,8,Fspecial educational needs and
OL,9,Fdisabilities (SEND). I'm really scared,
OL,10,Fso if I do some fumbles, please don't
OL,11,Flaugh," said Ridley.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
